# ==============================================================================
# CURSOR SYSTEM RULE: WP PLUGIN VERSION (EXPLICIT RELEASE ONLY)
# ==============================================================================

# Target File: omi-seo-ai-bridge.php (main plugin header)

Do not auto-increment version on ordinary edits.

Plugin distribution is GitHub Releases only:
- Tag: {version} (example 1.0.85; v-prefix also accepted by updater)
- Asset: wp-seo-ai-{version}.zip (folder `wp-seo-ai/` at ZIP root; main file `wp-seo-ai/omi-seo-ai-bridge.php`)
- Build: `php bin/build-plugin-release.php {version}` → `D:/work/build/wp-seo-ai-{version}.zip`
- Do not upload unversioned `wp-seo-ai.zip` or GitHub source archives as the installer.
- Legacy read-compat: `omi-seo-ai-bridge-{version}.zip` may still be accepted by updater; do not generate for new releases.
- Laravel observes/triggers updates; it does not host ZIP packages.

There is no Laravel Update Server packaging path.
